Package: blockforge
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @SIZE_KB@
Maintainer: BlockForge contributors <riyadmondol2006@gmail.com>
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk | xdg-desktop-portal-backend, xdg-utils, hicolor-icon-theme, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libpulse0, libudev1, libxrandr2, libxxf86vm1, libxext6, libxtst6
Suggests: gamemode
Replaces: blockforge (<< 4.0.0)
Conflicts: blockforge (<< 4.0.0)
Homepage: https://github.com/riyadmondol2006/BlockForge
Description: Fast, modern Minecraft launcher
 BlockForge installs and starts Minecraft: Java Edition. Every game lives in
 its own instance, with its own mods, settings and Java. It installs mods and
 modpacks from Modrinth, CurseForge, FTB, ATLauncher and Technic, imports
 instances from other launchers, supports Microsoft accounts and offline play,
 and starts quickly on modest computers.
 .
 This is the Rust edition. It replaces the Java edition and keeps its
 instances, accounts and settings in ~/.local/share/blockforge.
